      "headline": "Frost Advisory issued November 6 at 11:52AM EST until November 7 at 9:00AM EST by NWS Wilmington OH",
      "description": "* WHAT...Temperatures as low as 35 will result in frost formation.\n\n* WHERE...Portions of southeast Indiana, northeast and northern\nKentucky, and south central and southwest Ohio.\n\n* WHEN...From midnight tonight to 9 AM EST Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Frost could harm sensitive outdoor vegetation. Sensitive\noutdoor plants may be killed if left uncovered.",
